  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $14.15B (-1.1% 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/11/27/next-ecb-chief-favors-tokenized-bank-deposits-over-stablecoins-and-bitcoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Next ECB chief favors tokenized bank deposits over stablecoins and bitcoin</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows.</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-11-27-bank-of-japan-official-says-stablecoins-need-reserve-rules-to-preserve-singleness-of-money-447059\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bank of Japan official says stablecoins need reserve rules to preserve \u2018singleness of money\u2019</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-ipo-program-regulatory-approval-yi-he?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Binance to launch tokenized IPO program after regulatory approval: Yi He</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
